  "title": "Okta advances the industry standard for secure AI agent connections with expanding Cross App Access ecosystem",
  "summary": "Expanding Cross App Access ecosystem features the industry’s most critical applications and brings agent-to-app and app-to-app connections within Okta’s identity perimeter. 25 early adopters include Anthropic, Aquera, Archestra.AI, Asana, Atlassian, Canva, Cloudflare, Cursor, Datadog, Docker, Figma, Glean, Granola, Keycard, Keycloak, Linear, MintMCP, Scalekit, Serval, Slack, Stytch by Twilio, VS Code, WorkOS, Zoom, and Zuplo.",
